sequence Parley at Bath Town

tag Ship as s
  Revenge red
  Adventure blue
  Shore green

tag Risk as r
  Safe teal default
  Bribe orange
  Treachery purple

Captain is an actor

[Revenge] s: Revenge
  Captain
  Quartermaster
  Ledger is a database

[Adventure] s: Adventure
  Navigator
  Bosun s: Shore

[Bath Town] s: Shore
  Governor
  Customs

Captain -Sound the inlet-> Navigator
Navigator ~All clear~> Captain
Captain -Request parley-> Governor
note right of Governor Wants a cut of the cargo
Governor -Pardon, for a price-> Captain r: Bribe

== Paying the Governor ==

Captain -Fetch the haul-> Quartermaster
Quartermaster -Weigh the share-> Ledger
Ledger -Sixty pounds silver-> Quartermaster
Quartermaster -Chest of silver-> Governor r: Bribe

== Betrayal ==

Governor ~Offers a reward~> Bosun r: Treachery

if Bosun turns King's evidence
  Bosun ~Names the crew~> Customs r: Treachery
  Customs -Seize the Adventure-> Navigator r: Treachery
else
  Navigator -Weigh anchor-> Bosun
